---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shipping & Refund Policy | My Electronics Store">
  <div style="max-width:700px">
    <h1>Shipping & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">Last updated: [date]</p>
    <h3>Shipping</h3>
    <p>We ship across India. Orders are typically dispatched within [1–2] business days and delivered
      within [4–7] business days depending on your location. A flat shipping charge applies as shown
      at checkout, unless your order qualifies for free shipping.</p>
    <h3>Cancellations</h3>
    <p>Orders can be cancelled before they are shipped by contacting us at your-email@example.com.
      Once shipped, an order cannot be cancelled but may be eligible for return.</p>
    <h3>Returns</h3>
    <p>We accept returns within [7] days of delivery for items that are defective, damaged in transit,
      or incorrectly shipped. Electronic components are non-returnable once opened unless found
      defective, given the nature of the product. Contact us with your order number and photos of
      the issue to start a return.</p>
    <h3>Refunds</h3>
    <p>Approved refunds for online payments are credited back to the original payment method within
      [5–7] business days. For Cash on Delivery orders, refunds are made via bank transfer or UPI.</p>
  </div>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;max-width:700px">
    (Store owner note: this is a generic starter template, not legal advice. Fill in the bracketed
    timelines to match your actual process, and have it reviewed by your CA — accurate refund/shipping
    terms are also expected during Razorpay's KYC review.)
  </p>
</Layout>
